sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as 前端 / REST 调用方
    participant SM as ServiceManager
    participant SIO as SocketIoServer
    participant SX as socketioxide (io)
    participant AX as axum::serve
    participant CL as Socket.IO 客户端

    Note over UI,SM: === 启动阶段（按 protocol 分派）===
    UI->>SM: start(server_id)
    SM->>SM: 读取 cfg / sys，构造 TransportHooks 闭包
    alt cfg.protocol == "socket.io"
        SM->>SIO: Arc::new(SocketIoServer::new(cfg, sys, hooks))
        SM->>SIO: start()
        SIO->>SX: SocketIo::new_layer() -> (layer, io)
        SIO->>SX: io.ns("/", connect_handler)
        Note over SX: connect_handler 捕获 hooks / clients / server_id / protocol（Arc/Clone）
        SIO->>SIO: 绑定 TcpListener（端口冲突复用 release_port 重试）
        SIO->>AX: Router::new().layer(CorsLayer::permissive()).layer(layer)
        SIO->>AX: tokio::spawn(axum::serve(listener, router))
        AX-->>SIO: 返回 JoinHandle -> 取 abort_handle() 存入 self.abort
        SIO-->>SM: Ok(())
    else cfg.protocol == "websocket"
        SM->>SM: Arc::new_cyclic(WsServer::new(...))
        SM->>SM: ws.start()
    end
    SM->>SM: servers.insert(id, transport as Arc&lt;dyn Transport&gt;)
    SM->>SM: 更新 ServerRuntime.status = Running
    SM-->>UI: Ok(())

    Note over CL,SX: === 连接 / 消息 / 断开 映射 TransportHooks ===
    CL->>AX: HTTP 轮询握手 + WS 升级
    AX->>SX: 建立 Socket 连接
    SX->>SX: 触发 connect_handler(socket: SocketRef)
    SX->>SIO: clients.insert(socket.id.to_string(), socket.clone())
    SX->>SM: hooks.on_connect(ClientInfo{protocol: SocketIo, ...})
    SX->>SX: socket.on_disconnect(...) 注册
    SX->>SX: socket.on_fallback(...) 注册（捕获任意事件）

    CL->>AX: emit(event, data)
    AX->>SX: 收到客户端事件
    SX->>SX: on_fallback(event, data) 命中
    SX->>SM: hooks.on_message(socket_id, event, data)

    CL->>AX: 断开连接
    AX->>SX: 触发 disconnect
    SX->>SIO: on_disconnect(reason) -> clients.remove(socket_id)
    SX->>SM: hooks.on_disconnect(socket_id)

    Note over UI,SX: === 消息中心下发（send / broadcast）===
    UI->>SM: send_message(server_id, target, id, event, data)
    SM->>SIO: server.send(socket_id, event, data)  (dyn Transport)
    SIO->>SIO: clients.get(socket_id) -> SocketRef
    SIO->>CL: SocketRef.emit(event, data)

    Note over UI,SX: === 停止阶段 ===
    UI->>SM: stop(server_id)
    SM->>SIO: server.stop()  (dyn Transport)
    SIO->>SIO: running = false; abort.abort()
    SIO->>AX: 终止 axum::serve 任务
    SIO->>SIO: clients.clear(); io.take()（断开全部连接）
    SIO-->>SM: Ok(())
    SM->>SM: ServerRuntime.status = Stopped
    SM-->>UI: Ok(())
